title: 밤_2_조깅하기_서은표_영문
---
(I went out for a jog.)
(After running for about 10 minutes, I stopped for a moment to catch my breath.)
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: Oh! {name()}~
<<play 공통_조깅>>
(I looked back and saw EunPyo running toward me.)
<<show pyo_neg_ver2>>
(EunPyo stood next to me and caught her breath as well.)
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
EunPyo: Are you out for a run?
{name()}: Yeah. I think I've been running for about 10 minutes now...
<<choice 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_긍1_영문 "Sure. Let's run together." 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_부1_영문 "30 minutes might be a bit tough..." >>
EunPyo: Me too. My goal for today is to run for 30 minutes. Wanna join me?
===

title: 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_긍1_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
{name()}: Sure. Let's run together.
<<jump 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

