title: 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_분기1_영문
---
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
EunPyo: I'll match your pace.
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
EunPyo: Let's just run as much as we can!
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
<<play 공통_조깅>>
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
(We started running together, matching our pace.)
(I could feel EunPyo running with plenty of energy to spare.)
(But despite her consideration...)
(After about another 10 minutes, I reached my limit.)
(EunPyo still looks totally fresh.)
<<choice 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_긍2_영문 "Should we take a break for a second?" 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_부2_영문 "(Try to push through as much as possible.)">>
(Should I ask her to take a break?)
===

title: 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_긍2_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
{name()}: *Huff*... *puff*...
{name()}: *Huff*... EunPyo... should we... take a break?
<<show pyo_neg2_ver2>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: Oh?! Sorry. Was I running too fast?
(EunPyo, who was slightly ahead, stopped and looked back at me.)
<<jump 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_쉬는중_영문>>
===

title: 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_부2_영문
