(I've got my pride. Let's try to keep going as much as I can.)
(...)
{name()}: *Huff*... *gasp*... *wheeze*...
<<play 서은표_흠>>
<<show pyo_neg2_ver2>>
EunPyo: {name()}. Are you okay?
(I couldn't hold out any longer and ended up collapsing onto the ground.)
<<jump 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_쉬는중_영문>>
===

title: 주2_화_밤_조깅하기_서은표_쉬는중_영문
---
<<show pyo_neg_ver2>>
EunPyo: Are you really tired? Well, we did run for quite a while.
{name()}: *Pant*... how long did we run?
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: About 10 minutes?
EunPyo: Here, sit on the bench and rest for a bit.
{name()}: Thanks...
<<show pyo_idle_ver2>>
(As I lowered my head while sitting on the bench, EunPyo wrapped a sports towel around my neck.)
EunPyo: Stay here for a second.
(While EunPyo was away for a moment, I closed my eyes and caught my breath.)
(Man, was I always this out of shape...?)
(It really hits me again how amazing the soccer club members are.)
EunPyo: Here, drink this.
(EunPyo handed me an ionic drink.)
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
EunPyo: I got it from the vending machine over there.
{name()}: Thanks...
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: You're actually a better runner than I thought! I think you could even join the soccer club.
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
(I drank the drink. Now that my thirst is gone, I feel much better.)
<<show pyo_neg_ver2>>
EunPyo: You should head in and rest for today. I have to finish my run...
{name()}: Okay. Thanks for looking out for me...
<<show pyo_smile_ver2>>
EunPyo: No problem. It's a bummer we can't hang out longer, though.
EunPyo: See you at school.
<<end>>
===